    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Is This Game?</h2>The simulation training room is a secret base. At here you can connects to the virtual world and kills zombies to gain experience and upgrades.<br>After each connection to the virtual world, you have an hour for keep connect.<br>Over time, the zombies will become stronger, and the dropped items will also be different.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playing Method</h2>Select a virtual scene and connect to it.<br>Killing zombies increases level, and after upgrading, skill points can be allocated within the base to become more powerful.<br>The longer the virtual scene takes, the higher the probability of obtaining spoils of war.(It will be presented within the secret base)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fee</h2>This game is completely free and without any internal purchases. You will experience the complete game.",
